{"stories":[{"d":"There used to be one god above them all, but the days of the Pantokrator are long gone. The very memory of his name erased from history, the backlash of his fall has eaten away most of the world, and still to this day the forces of entropy threaten its very existence. Monsters roam the land, emerging from dungeons scattered all across, stuck in a cycle of being cleared and reforming. Only the return of deities, with the blessings they confer to adventurers, allowed humankind to continue to exist, and even to thrive. But is it enough to save the future?","i":["https://cdn3.fiction.live/images/1ga13qe9s_city_of_brass_by_carloscara_d7qybf3-pre.jpg"],"likeCount":96,"ta":["fantasy","rpg","mostdicerollsbehindthescenes","notadanmachiquest","femaleprotagonist"],"cht":1791408937094,"p":72886,"isLive":true,"t":"Is it okay to accrue divinity in a dungeon?","u":[{"a":"https://cdn3.fiction.live/images/1f1vn3t4p___maria_and_pi_space_maria_drawn_by_david_liu__0f3381a28a5b7c39cb8cec01aaae5b46.jpg","_id":"GBD3f2hMx6mhHdngu","n":"magicalprincess"}],"w":1534991,"hype":1,"contentRating":"nsfw","rInteract":"medium","ut":1791495180366,"_id":"RPLW6jdhxy7ooEeiw"},{"d":"In the new world of cowboys and monster girls, there remains one singular truth. You don't fuck with the guy that brings you your mail. Unfortunately for you, a lot of monster girls and reprobates didn't get the memo.","i":["https://cdn3.fiction.live/images/1gs4id9np_874.jpg"],"likeCount":266,"ta":["monstergirlencyclopedia","wildwest","postpostapocalypse","postapocalypse","monsterisation","transformation","cutegirls","smut","dicepool","cowboys","cowgirls","dragongirl","cowboy","himboprotag","mprotag","maleprotag","guns","cutes","mailman","mail","thepostoffice","courier","eros","mara","chiefgoddess","angel","ushioni"],"cht":1791491865329,"p":175539,"isLive":true,"t":"Peacekeepers and Monster Girls","u":[{"a":"https://ddx5i92cqts4o.cloudfront.net/images/1ds53dok4_Smuggy.jpg","_id":"eApJePe9d52WPf4EL","n":"spi